OL,3,APoundland's former owner offers to
OL,4,Ainvest in firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoundland's former owner has said he
OL,7,Fwould invest in the firm as a
OL,8,Fgovernment minister said she would meet
OL,9,Fthe firm's board.
OL,11,FSteve Smith, who left the Walsall-based
OL,12,Fbusiness in 2006, said he had attempted
OL,13,Fto contact owners Gordon Brothers
OL,14,Fhaving been "really surprised" to learn
OL,15,Fabout them filing for administration
OL,16,Fwhen sales were up 11% on last year.
OL,18,FThe BBC understands that Business
OL,19,FMinister Kate Dearden will meet with
OL,20,Fsenior Poundland executives later this
OL,21,Fweek to discuss the company's
OL,22,Fthreatened insolvency.
